        dcterms:description "6-panel synthesis figure including universal phase collapse, 2D target-wave kymograph + disc inset, 4-explant scaling regression, geometric decay, SEM segmentation, and waveform fit — docs/media/ex_vivo_scaling_mPSM_comparison.png: rendered output of 2014-lauschke-ex-vivo-scaling-mPSM.py at 317bc3c, image/png, 1601237 B, 2775×1650 px, artifact_sha256 d9af4f6b242811a74790adc26b77d614cc1d0e6bdd1286546bd4a3dd4e8185d7 (sha256 d9af4f6b242811a74790adc26b77d614cc1d0e6bdd1286546bd4a3dd4e8185d7), spec_fingerprint 0664f71d3f534bae2179e8241d0641469c79bbe4d267f1da6ae7e8f684b90e69" .

